1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,970
Built for ninety Martian days,

2
00:00:01,990 --> 00:00:03,210
Opportunity kept going

3
00:00:03,230 --> 00:00:04,830
for over fourteen years.

4
00:00:04,900 --> 00:00:06,830
This light is its real route,

5
00:00:06,850 --> 00:00:08,180
from NASA's records.

6
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:10,070
In 2005, a sand dune trapped

7
00:00:10,090 --> 00:00:12,220
it for more than five weeks.

8
00:00:12,400 --> 00:00:14,840
At Esperance, its arm ground into a rock,

9
00:00:14,860 --> 00:00:16,650
then read what it was made of:

10
00:00:16,670 --> 00:00:18,960
clay minerals, from gentler water.

11
00:00:20,300 --> 00:00:23,520
In June 2018, a dust storm blocked the Sun.

12
00:00:23,540 --> 00:00:26,490
The solar-powered rover fell silent.

13
00:00:26,800 --> 00:00:28,060
Echoes of the Cosmos.

14
00:00:28,080 --> 00:00:29,840
Follow the whole journey.
